Subject: [PATCH 1/2] WIP: build v3.0.0 with gradle-1.0 from build files in the
 1.0 DSL (not finished)

Stopped: the gap 1.0 -> 3.0 needs more and more changes (28 script plugins, distributions project);
going through 2.0 first. Done so far:
- settings.gradle.1.0 (without docs and test-only projects), buildSrc/settings.gradle (conditional, 1.0)
- .1.0 copies of the build files and script plugins (apply from: the .1.0 copies)
- compile.gradle: JavaCompile -> Compile; dependencies.gradle: eachDependency -> force
- buildSrc: idea/eclipse/code quality dropped, docs helpers, ShadedJar, JsoupCopyExtension not compiled
- repositories through scripts/maven-proxy.py (gradle-1.0 has no https without SNI on Java 7);
  repo.gradle.org does not mirror Maven Central anymore
- org.gradle.build-types (full plugin id), javascript-base -> ivy repository (googleapis)
- tooling-api: shaded jar, sources jar, buildship, eclipse left out
Next: the root script plugins (testGroupings...), then the projects.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
